  m_Name: Cabbage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WILCommunityGame.InformationTipSO
  text: Cabbage is a nutritious vegetable commonly used in South African home cooking.
    It provides vitamins C and K and can be included in many affordable meals. Growing
    cabbage locally can help families access fresh vegetables without relying entirely
    on food purchased from shops.
